                <div class="role-warning-banner">
                    <span class="role-warning-icon">⚠️</span>
                    <span>Changes here are <strong>temporary (run-scoped)</strong>. They persist across restarts but reset when a new project begins. For permanent changes, use the <a href="/configuration">Configuration page</a>.</span>
